Description: Calculates Herd Lying Concordance metrics from individual animal
    lying-behaviour data. Herd Lying Concordance is a framework for
    quantifying group-level behavioural cohesion from the distribution of
    individual lying behaviour within observation intervals. The package
    supports multiple dispersion-based implementations, threshold synchrony
    comparisons, lying-weighted extensions, daily summaries, and descriptive
    method-ranking tools.
